{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO VERSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo lets you experience terraforming with pressure and temperature up to Stage 6. All other core survival, crafting, exploration, and rover systems are fully available.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TERRAFORM MARS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862480/extras/8a4905734d9466e562eebf303c05606f.poster.avif?t=1759844879\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862480/extras/8a4905734d9466e562eebf303c05606f.webm?t=1759844879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862480/extras/8a4905734d9466e562eebf303c05606f.mp4?t=1759844879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Mars step by step as you build powerful terraforming machines to increase atmospheric pressure and raise temperatures, and watch the barren surface transform into a living, breathing world just like Earth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GATHER RESOURCES, CRAFT, SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862480/extras/984167f40842416e40278677eb8415ca.poster.avif?t=1759844879\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862480/extras/984167f40842416e40278677eb8415ca.webm?t=1759844879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862480/extras/984167f40842416e40278677eb8415ca.mp4?t=1759844879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness Mars\u2019 raw resources, refine materials, and use 3D printers to build machines and structures. Manage power, unlock blueprints, upgrade your tools and craft everything you need to survive in a harsh and changing environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE MOBILE BASES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862480/extras/68aba5f9e23342775c7e7a84ecd22a31.poster.avif?t=1759844879\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862480/extras/68aba5f9e23342775c7e7a84ecd22a31.webm?t=1759844879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862480/extras/68aba5f9e23342775c7e7a84ecd22a31.mp4?t=1759844879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and customize modular rovers, attach functional modules like batteries, storage, and mining lasers, and chain them into convoys. Drive across the planet, mine on the go, and create fully mobile or stationary outposts for deep exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862480/extras/341ce88d80232470cc0b888797a8ab9d.poster.avif?t=1759844879\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862480/extras/341ce88d80232470cc0b888797a8ab9d.webm?t=1759844879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862480/extras/341ce88d80232470cc0b888797a8ab9d.mp4?t=1759844879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE MYSTERY OF LONG-LOST LIFE</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862480/extras/fac3c30dbfa473c2ba6e901c266c6f7d.poster.avif?t=1759844879\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862480/extras/fac3c30dbfa473c2ba6e901c266c6f7d.webm?t=1759844879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862480/extras/fac3c30dbfa473c2ba6e901c266c6f7d.mp4?t=1759844879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned terraforming stations, ancient machines, and wrecked ships scattered across the planet. Visit orbital platforms, uncover forgotten technology, and piece together what happened to Earth and those who came before you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3862480?t=1759844879","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3862480?t=1759844879","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862480/5d5468e1726021817c398aa86c7306b115d552a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759844879","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862480/5d5468e1726021817c398aa86c7306b115d552a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759844879","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"